ight', 'start_time': '2025-06-10 07:55', 'end_time': '2025-06-10 11:14', 'duration': 379, 'price': 589.0, 'details': 'Flight: AA 179 (American Airlines) direct from JFK to SFO, duration is 379 minutes. Comfortable legroom (31 in) and Wi-Fi for a fee.'}, {'from_city': 'New York', 'to_city': 'San Francisco', 'mode': 'flight', 'start_time': '2025-06-10 08:20', 'end_time': '2025-06-10 11:54', 'duration': 394, 'price': 661.0, 'details': 'Flight: B6 215 (JetBlue) direct from JFK to SFO, duration is 394 minutes. Above average legroom (32 in) and free Wi-Fi available.'}, {'from_city': 'New York', 'to_city': 'San Francisco', 'mode': 'flight', 'start_time': '2025-06-10 09:30', 'end_time': '2025-06-10 12:59', 'duration': 389, 'price': 693.0, 'details': 'Flight: AS 33 (Alaska Airlines) direct from JFK to SFO, duration is 389 minutes. Wi-Fi for a fee and average legroom (31 in).'}, {'from_city': 'San Francisco', 'to_city': 'Los Angeles', 'mode': 'rental car', 'start_time': '2025-06-12 09:00', 'end_time': '2025-06-12 12:30', 'duration': 210, 'price': 300.0, 'details': 'A rental car from SIXT offers one-way options from San Francisco to Los Angeles with no additional drop-off fee. The drive typically takes around 3 to 4 hours depending on traffic conditions. You can pick up the car at the airport or city center locations. It provides flexibility in travel time and scenic views along the Pacific Coast Highway. Make sure to book in advance to secure the best rate.'}, {'from_city': 'San Francisco', 'to_city': 'Los Angeles', 'mode': 'rental car', 'start_time': '2025-06-12 08:00', 'end_time': '2025-06-12 12:00', 'duration': 240, 'price': 270.0, 'details': 'An alternative rental from Budget offering a compact car for the journey. This option is slightly cheaper and has pickup availability at various locations. The duration is about 4 hours, potentially giving a scenic drive option via Pacific Coast Highway. Ensure to check for any promotional discounts that might apply.'}, {'from_city':