afood cuisine, and nearby hiking opportunities in the Marin Headlands align perfectly with your preferences.", 'start_date': '2025-06-10', 'end_date': '2025-06-12', 'duration': 2, 'total_budget': 1000.0}, {'name': 'Los Angeles', 'description': 'Los Angeles is renowned for its Hollywood attractions like the Hollywood Walk of Fame and offers diverse experiences including beaches in Santa Monica and hiking options in Griffith Park. This city combines urban scenic views with entertainment and local cuisine, making it an excellent fit for your itinerary.', 'start_date': '2025-06-12', 'end_date': '2025-06-15', 'duration': 3, 'total_budget': 1500.0}, {'name': 'Yosemite National Park', 'description': 'As a must-see destination for nature enthusiasts, Yosemite National Park features stunning landscapes, waterfalls, and miles of hiking trails. Spending time here offers a counterbalance to the urban experiences in San Francisco and Los Angeles, allowing for relaxation and adventure in nature.', 'start_date': '2025-06-15', 'end_date': '2025-06-18', 'duration': 3, 'total_budget': 1500.0}, {'name': 'San Diego', 'description': 'San Diego rounds out your trip with its beautiful beach activities, local American cuisine, and vibrant downtown. Visiting places like Balboa Park and the San Diego Zoo provides cultural experiences, while the beach offers relaxation and recreational options. This city offers a laid-back vibe perfect for winding down your trip.', 'start_date': '2025-06-18', 'end_date': '2025-06-20', 'duration': 2, 'total_budget': 1000.0}], 'intercity_transit': [{'from_city': 'New York', 'to_city': 'San Francisco', 'mode': 'flight', 'start_time': '2025-06-10 06:59', 'end_time': '2025-06-10 12:24', 'duration': 505, 'price': 362.0, 'details': 'Flight: F9 3237 (Frontier) from JFK to LAS at 06:59, layover for 45 min, then Flight: F9 3019 to SFO arriving at 12:24. Total duration including layover is 505 minutes.'}, {'from_city': 'New York', 'to_city': 'San Francisco', 'mode': 'fl